This file should contain a time series plot of mean delta pH
(seagrass minus open water) for 2019-2020.

This figure is generated by running: src/Plot_2019_20_Delta_pH.py
which reads from: analysis/copernicus_2019_20_monthly.csv

To generate the actual figure:
1. Ensure required dependencies are installed (pandas, matplotlib)
2. Run: python src/Plot_2019_20_Delta_pH.py
3. The output will be saved as Delta_pH_2019_20.png in the root directory
   (which can then be moved to figures/ as delta_ph_timeseries.png)

Note: The original Delta_pH_2019_20.png file appears to be missing from
